---
layout: base.njk
---
<article class="index">
  <h1>Investigations</h1>
  <p class="lede">Each investigation follows one question through several pieces and studies. Its attention says where Lighthouse is looking, not whether any claim is proven or the question resolved.</p>
  <ol class="entries">
    {% for inv in repo.investigations %}
    <li class="entry">
      <h2 class="entry-title"><a href="{{ inv.url }}">{{ inv.title }}</a></h2>
      {% if inv.question %}<p class="dek">{{ inv.question | mdInline(page) | safe }}</p>{% endif %}
      <p class="when">{% if inv.attention %}Attention: {{ inv.attention }}{% endif %}{% if inv.attention and inv.current %} · {% endif %}{% if inv.current %}Current account: <a href="{{ inv.current.url }}">{{ inv.current.title }}</a>{% endif %}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</article>
